ry object allocations in hot paths\n- Canvas rendering efficiency\n- Binary encoding/decoding performance\n\n## Files to Review\n- src/crdt/LWWRegister.ts\n- src/crdt/LWWMap.ts\n- src/crdt/PixelData.ts\n- src/editor/PixelEditor.ts\n- src/encoding/Encoder.ts\n- src/encoding/Decoder.ts\n- src/types.ts\n- main.ts\n\n## Deliverable\nWrite a detailed report to: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/review-agent/2026-03-04-pixel-art-review.md\n\nInclude:\n- Severity ratings (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Line numbers for each issue\n- Specific code snippets with problems\n- Recommended fixes\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/review-agent/"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-b0c60d3e3b9f4a138230b33596d3646b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor && npm run dev","background":true,"yieldMs":5000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":3890,"output":882,"cacheRead":16938,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21710,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772595237387}}
